   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Building the impersonal «si»",
     "texto": [
      "To generalise or express impersonal sentences («one works», «one eats», «one says»), Italian places the particle **si** before the verb in the **third person singular**: **Qui si lavora con impegno** (here people work with dedication); **In Italia si mangia bene** (in Italy people eat well); **Come si scrive?** (how is it written?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Prohibition and permission notices",
     "texto": [
      "To regulate public and office behaviour, **è vietato + infinitive** (it is forbidden) or **si può + infinitive** (it is allowed) is used: **È vietato fumare** (smoking is forbidden); **Qui si può entrare?** (can one come in here?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
